## 📦 Configuration

### Recommended config.toml

```toml
# ~/.codex/config.toml
model = "gpt-4o"

[model_providers.openai]
base_url = "https://api.openai.com/v1"
env_key = "OPENAI_API_KEY"
wire_api = "chat"

[sandbox]
default_mode = "read-only"

[approval]
policy = "on-request"

[mcp_servers.codex-agent]
command = "codex"
args = ["mcp-server"]
```

